KG42.register("clusters-d65bd61d79f99164a720e10e",{"id":"48-multiple_energy_carrier_market::v142-d-K003","paper":"48-multiple_energy_carrier_market","label":"Uniform-price settlement applicability rules for binding-hour results","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K003","label":"Uniform-price settlement applicability rules for binding-hour results","market_meaning":"Financial settlement uses only the clearing results of the binding hours in the rolling time domain; an accepted bid uses its applicable market price as the basis for receipt and payment, and the results of subsequent consultation hours do not enter this round of financial settlement.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["clearing","pricing","settlement"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"This cluster expresses the period selection for settlement results and the uniform-price basis, with obtaining the applicable clearing results and prices as input conditions. The shared clearing and pricing chains provide only the interface, and their unresolved mathematical and currency issues are retained; this cluster does not claim that a payment-amount model has been fully established.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"The finality of clearing, locational prices, and the scope adopted for financial settlement have an explicit result-transfer relationship, but the settlement applicability rule has an independent financial meaning, so a separate cluster is established and only the upstream outputs are shared.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R009","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Bears the primary attribution of the binding-hour settlement scope and the market-price basis for calculating payment."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Provides the full time-domain clearing results and the distinction between binding and consultation hours, and does not reassert the clearing rules."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R007","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Provides the applicable price interface resolved by time, by energy carrier, and by location; the pricing conditions and unresolved issues still belong to its primary cluster."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K003-L001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C011"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E013","v141-b-g03-E01"],"rationale":"Full time-domain results are used for financial settlement after selection of the binding hours; the fact that consultation results can be updated is not equivalent to a need to settle or resettle them."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K003-L002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::x::v141-c-R007-x-lambda","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C004"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C002","v141-c-R009::E::v141-c-R009-E002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E009","v141-b-g01-E016","v141-b-g01-E040","v141-b-g03-E01"],"rationale":"The payment basis of an accepted bid is the applicable market price; this mapping only associates the price output with the settlement basis and does not add a price variable or an amount formula for R009."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-O001","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R003::V::clearing.local","v141-c-R007::V::clearing.local","v141-c-R009::V::clearing.local"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R003::V::clearing.local","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E022","v141-b-g01-E040","v141-b-g03-E01"],"rationale":"The settlement and pricing interfaces cite the same local-market clearing; the representative node does not convert every full time-domain result into a settleable result."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-O002","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R007::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R009::V::pricing.local"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R007::V::pricing.local","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E009","v141-b-g01-E016","v141-b-g01-E040"],"rationale":"The market price in the payment basis comes from the existing local pricing function; the bid valuation and the clearing price are not treated as the same quantity."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G001","category":"unverified_source","description":"Binding-hour settlement and the uniform-price basis are both candidate interpretations supported by evidence that is currently unaudited.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R009","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R007"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C001","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E009","v141-b-g01-E016","v141-b-g01-E040","v141-b-g03-E01"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually confirm the source of the settlement period and of the pricing basis; do not interpret the candidate-assembly status as the source having been verified."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G002","category":"upstream_missing","description":"The frozen settlement chain does not provide an amount formula, receipt and payment signs, payment execution, or deviation handling; the currency and dual scale of the upstream price also remain unresolved. What can currently be assembled is therefore the settlement applicability basis, and a complete payment-calculation and execution mechanism cannot be claimed on this basis.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R009","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R003"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C001","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C002","v141-c-R007::x::v141-c-R007-x-lambda","v141-c-R003::x::v141-c-R003-X001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E002","v141-b-g01-E009","v141-b-g01-E016","v141-b-g02-E01","v141-b-g03-E01"],"proposal_ids":["proposal:trading-horizon"],"required_work":"If this is to be extended to amount-calculation and execution rules, the upstream price units should first be resolved, and the upstream should then supply explicit payment and execution evidence; the unapproved status of the binding-hour and consultation-hour proposals continues to be retained."}]},"rule_refs":["48-multiple_energy_carrier_market::v141-c-R009","48-multiple_energy_carrier_market::v141-c-R003","48-multiple_energy_carrier_market::v141-c-R007"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-51f1ed6d657e2673","COMP-6057789601b08e93","KG40-4a0e4a04a308d0b9","KG40-72006c4bf7355110","KG40-80b56ab23344a0b7","KG40-91eceef212419ef6"]});
